---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="AI Transparency & Responsible Use Statement"
  description="Learn how BBK Marketing Solutions uses artificial intelligence to improve client communication, response times, educational content, and service quality while maintaining human oversight and accountability."
  effectiveDate="November 18, 2026"
  updatedDate="November 18, 2026"
>
  <h2>1. Our Commitment</h2>
  <p>
    BBK Marketing Solutions uses artificial intelligence (&ldquo;AI&rdquo;) as a support tool to improve speed,
    consistency, accessibility, and the overall experience of prospective and current clients.
  </p>
  <p>
    We believe AI should enhance human work, not remove human responsibility. Our use of AI is guided by
    transparency, proportionality, privacy, and human oversight.
  </p>
  <p>
    This statement explains where AI may be used, what it may do, what it does not replace, and how
    responsibility remains with BBK Marketing Solutions.
  </p>

  <h2>2. How We Use AI</h2>
  <p>AI may be used to support:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Basic and frequently asked questions.</li>
    <li>Faster initial responses to prospective clients.</li>
    <li>Routing inquiries to the appropriate person or department.</li>
    <li>Communication outside normal business hours when appropriate.</li>
    <li>Continuity and flow of basic conversations.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    These systems are continuously refined using approved business information, updated service knowledge, and
    reviewed communication patterns to improve response quality.
  </p>
  <p>AI may also assist, in whole or in part, with:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Educational articles.</li>
    <li>Social media content.</li>
    <li>Informational materials.</li>
    <li>Topic summaries.</li>
    <li>Research and editorial workflows.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Content intended for publication may be reviewed, edited, or approved by a human before release, particularly
    when accuracy, reputation, compliance, or client impact is significant.
  </p>

  <h2>3. What AI Does Not Replace</h2>
  <p>AI does not replace:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Final business decisions.</li>
    <li>Contract approval.</li>
    <li>Legal review.</li>
    <li>Financial approval.</li>
    <li>Strategic accountability.</li>
    <li>Human responsibility for client relationships.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    When a matter requires judgment, negotiation, approval, or a decision with material consequences,
    responsibility remains with an authorized human representative of BBK Marketing Solutions.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Human Oversight and Accountability</h2>
  <p>BBK Marketing Solutions remains responsible for the systems and workflows it chooses to use.</p>
  <p>
    Where appropriate, AI-supported interactions may be reviewed by team members, escalated to a human, corrected,
    or discontinued.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Transparency in AI-Assisted Interactions</h2>
  <p>
    When AI is used in a way that could reasonably affect a user&rsquo;s understanding of who or what they are
    interacting with, BBK Marketing Solutions may provide clear notice that AI or automated technology is
    involved.
  </p>
  <p>The level of disclosure may vary depending on:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>The type of interaction.</li>
    <li>The level of automation.</li>
    <li>The sensitivity of the information involved.</li>
    <li>The potential impact on the user.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>6. Data and Privacy</h2>
  <p>AI tools may process information only as necessary to support the function for which they are used.</p>
  <p>
    The collection, use, retention, and protection of personal information are governed by our
    <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a> and applicable contractual or legal requirements.
  </p>
  <p>This statement does not replace our Privacy Policy.</p>
  <p>
    Unless expressly stated otherwise, BBK Marketing Solutions does not represent that personal information
    submitted by clients is used to train public AI models.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Continuous Improvement</h2>
  <p>
    AI-supported workflows may evolve over time. We may update prompts, knowledge bases, response rules, approved
    information, escalation criteria, and other controls to improve accuracy, response quality, consistency,
    safety, and client experience.
  </p>

  <h2>8. Limitations</h2>
  <p>AI-generated or AI-assisted responses may occasionally be incomplete, inaccurate, or unsuitable for a specific situation.</p>
  <p>
    Users should not rely on an automated response as a substitute for professional legal, financial, medical, or
    other regulated advice.
  </p>
  <p>
    If a matter is important, sensitive, contractual, or requires a final decision, users should request
    assistance from a human representative.
  </p>

  <h2>9. Requesting Human Assistance</h2>
  <p>
    Any user interacting with an AI-supported communication channel may request human assistance when needed.
  </p>
  <p>BBK Marketing Solutions may also transfer an interaction to a human when:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>The request is outside the approved scope.</li>
    <li>The information is sensitive.</li>
    <li>The user requests escalation.</li>
    <li>A decision requires human judgment.</li>
    <li>The system detects uncertainty or risk.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>10. Updates to This Statement</h2>
  <p>
    BBK Marketing Solutions may update this statement as our use of AI changes, as new technologies are adopted,
    or as legal and industry expectations evolve.
  </p>

  <h2>11. Contact</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>BBK Marketing Solutions</strong><br />
    Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}><strong>{site.email}</strong></a><br />
    Website: <a href="https://bbk-marketing.com"><strong>https://bbk-marketing.com</strong></a>
  </p>

  <h2>Relationship to Other Policies</h2>
  <p>This statement should be read together with our:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a></li>
    <li><a href="/terms-and-conditions">Terms &amp; Conditions</a></li>
    <li><a href="/cookie-policy">Cookie Policy</a></li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    If there is a conflict between this statement and a binding agreement, applicable law, or a specific
    contractual obligation, the controlling requirement will apply.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Important:</strong> This statement is intended to describe BBK Marketing Solutions&rsquo; current
    approach to AI transparency and responsible use. It is not legal advice.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
